# Files copied into every Claude Code worktree (.claude/worktrees/<slug>/).
#
# Syntax is .gitignore-style. Only paths that match a pattern AND are
# gitignored are copied, so tracked files are never duplicated. Without this,
# a fresh worktree has no Android SDK path and no agent permission allowlist,
# so the native/Gradle build and `android:*` CLI calls fail on first run.
#
# See docs/contributor/build-performance.md "Parallel agent builds" and
# AGENTS.md "Git Worktree & Commit Workflow".

# Android SDK location — Gradle/native build cannot resolve the SDK without it.
local.properties

# Claude Code per-machine permission allowlist (carries Bash(android:*)).
.claude/settings.json

# Local environment overrides, if present.
.env
.env.local
